<BaseLayout title="Research | Md Arif Hossain" description="Research interests and documented contributions in operations research, combinatorial mathematics, and manufacturing systems.">
 <div class="container page-shell"><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH / INTERESTS & CONTRIBUTIONS</p><h1>Rigorous models for <em>complex decisions.</em></h1><p class="page-lead">My academic direction combines the structure of discrete mathematics, the expressiveness of optimization models, and the realities of decision-making in industrial systems.</p></header>
