 <section class="content-section two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / RESEARCH PROJECT</p><h2>Matrix methods for posets & lattices</h2></div><div class="prose-block"><p class="mini-label">SUST Research Center · Sep 2023–May 2024</p><h3>Implementation of Matrix Methods for Combinatorial Aspects of Posets and Lattices</h3><p>Under project investigator <strong>Dr. Mohammad Salah Uddin</strong>, I examined matrix-based representations of finite partially ordered sets and lattice-theoretic structures. I developed computational methods using MATLAB to analyze combinatorial and algebraic relationships.</p><p>Project No. <strong>PS/2023/1/19</strong></p><a class="inline-link" href="/projects/posets-lattices/">Read research summary ↗</a></div></section>
 <section class="content-section two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / UNDERGRADUATE THESIS</p><h2>Infinite matrices & numerical methods</h2></div><div class="prose-block"><h3>On the Determinant, Inverse, and Eigenvalues of Infinite Matrices</h3><p>Studied determinants, inverses, eigenvalues, matrix logarithms, convergence, and series-expansion methods for infinite matrices, including computational approaches to numerical approximation.</p></div></section>
 <section class="content-section"><p class="eyebrow">04 / PRESENTATIONS & SCHOLARLY WORK</p><h2>Documented research contributions</h2><p class="section-note">Statuses are reported as recorded in my CV. Conference talks are distinguished from journal publications, and the submitted work is not presented as accepted.</p><div class="paper-list">{outputs.map((o,i)=><article class="paper-item"><span class="paper-number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><p class="mini-label">{o.status}</p><h3>{o.title}</h3><p>{o.authors}</p><p class="muted">{o.venue}</p>{o.url && <a class="inline-link" href={o.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Presentation certificate ↗</a>}</div></article>)}</div></section>
 <section class="cta-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</p><h2>Research meets implementation.</h2><p>Explore mathematical programming, numerical research, and industrial decision analytics.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/projects/">View projects ↗</a></section>
